@startuml
title SA-L01 · 概念数据与逻辑责任
caption UC-01～08 / BRD §6 / To-Be Proposed
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam shadowing false
hide methods
class "账号与身份" as Identity
class "项目与需求" as Req
class "配置与版本" as Config
class "一次运行及生效需求" as Run
class "阶段节点、角色任务和尝试" as Tasks
class "聊天问题与答复" as Chat
class "发起设备" as Dev
class "工件、检查与发布证据" as Evidence
Identity "1" --> "*" Req : 当前负责人
Identity "*" -- "*" Config : 配置角色关系
Req "1" -- "*" Run : 需求的运行
Run "*" --> "1" Config : 固定版本
Run "*" --> "1" Dev : 绑定执行身份
Run "1" -- "*" Tasks : 所选任务与历史
Run "1" -- "*" Chat : 持久问答
Tasks "1" -- "*" Evidence : 产物及证据来源
Chat "*" --> "1" Tasks : 定向会话
note bottom of Run : 平台记录共享运行、授权和状态。\n本机持有执行会话与恢复材料。
@enduml
